guarantee: AC-2: a redirect to another origin (another scheme on the same host and port) is refused
file: crates/voicen-core/src/engine/http.rs
added_by: test-writer
--- old
    next.origin() == first.origin()
--- new
    next.host_str() == first.host_str() && next.port_or_known_default() == first.port_or_known_default()
--- end
